And that's what I was

00:09:16.822 --> 00:09:17.490
think about when I went to the

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.125
well the thousands of young people here

00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:19.458
who are saying

00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:20.693
we are scared for our lives

00:09:20.693 --> 00:09:21.260
for our future

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:22.562
who begged this body to act.

00:09:22.562 --> 00:09:24.263
That's why I stood up there in the well

00:09:24.263 --> 00:09:24.931
and I will continue.

00:09:24.931 --> 00:09:25.665
I will do it again

00:09:25.665 --> 00:09:26.799
and I'll continue to stand for them

00:09:26.799 --> 00:09:28.334
because this is an issue of life

00:09:28.334 --> 00:09:28.801
or death.

00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:30.136
We need to remove these weapons of war

00:09:30.136 --> 00:09:31.137
from our community

00:09:31.137 --> 00:09:31.837
and we need to make sure

00:09:31.837 --> 00:09:33.239
that our schools are zones

00:09:33.239 --> 00:09:34.173
that our children can flourish,

00:09:34.173 --> 00:09:35.207
not just survive,

00:09:35.207 --> 00:09:36.208
but thrive and flourish.

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:37.410
That's what I'm fighting for.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.077
And so I would

00:09:38.077 --> 00:09:39.111
I would stand that well again.

00:09:39.111 --> 00:09:40.079
I would fight for

00:09:40.146 --> 00:09:41.948
no titles worth the future.

00:09:41.948 --> 00:09:42.915
I want my kids to live in

00:09:42.915 --> 00:09:44.083
what is a safety

00:09:44.083 --> 00:09:45.384
from from this proliferation

00:09:45.384 --> 00:09:47.253
of militarized guns in our community.

00:09:47.253 --> 00:09:48.321
When you

00:09:48.588 --> 00:09:49.789
try to get your seat back,

00:09:49.789 --> 00:09:50.222
you plan

00:09:50.222 --> 00:09:51.924
to fight to be back in this same house.

00:09:51.924 --> 00:09:52.625
I mean, what they did

00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:53.826
is unconstitutional, I believe.

00:09:53.826 --> 00:09:54.860
So we'll fight legally.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.362
But but you know what?

00:09:56.362 --> 00:09:57.730
They did today was not try and expel me.

00:09:57.730 --> 00:09:58.931
They're trying to expel our movement.

00:09:58.931 --> 00:10:00.533
And that's they're unsuccessful.

00:10:00.533 --> 00:10:01.100
If you look around at all

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:01.934
these young people

00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:03.202
and so whether I'm inside the chamber,

00:10:03.202 --> 00:10:04.036
outside the chamber,

00:10:04.036 --> 00:10:05.037
we will continue to fight.

00:10:05.037 --> 00:10:06.372
We'll continue to push the issue

00:10:06.372 --> 00:10:08.307
because today demonstrated for the nation

00:10:08.307 --> 00:10:11.744
that we in Tennessee are not a democracy.

00:10:11.744 --> 00:10:13.412
And that should scare us all.

00:10:13.412 --> 00:10:14.914
If you were talking to a Republican

00:10:14.914 --> 00:10:16.682
who may not agree

00:10:16.682 --> 00:10:17.783
with everything that you're saying,

00:10:17.783 --> 00:10:18.451
you know, people,

00:10:18.451 --> 00:10:20.620
especially in the South. Love of guns.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:21.187
Is there anything

00:10:21.187 --> 00:10:21.988
that you can say to them

00:10:21.988 --> 00:10:23.222
that you would want to change, that

00:10:23.222 --> 00:10:23.889
you could see that

00:10:23.889 --> 00:10:24.624
maybe both sides

00:10:24.624 --> 00:10:26.559
could come to some sort of agreement?

00:10:26.559 --> 00:10:26.926
I think,

00:10:26.926 --> 00:10:27.460
I mean,

00:10:27.493 --> 00:10:28.694
the majority of Americans

00:10:28.694 --> 00:10:30.062
support common sense gun laws,

00:10:30.062 --> 00:10:30.997
universal background

00:10:30.997 --> 00:10:32.398
checks, red flag laws.

00:10:32.398 --> 00:10:33.466
I mean, these are commonsense

00:10:33.466 --> 00:10:34.200
things that we need.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.201
We can act for

00:10:35.201 --> 00:10:36.402
But there's this extreme group,

00:10:36.402 --> 00:10:37.236
an extreme faction

00:10:37.236 --> 00:10:38.704
who is beholden to the NRA,

00:10:38.704 --> 00:10:39.672
like my colleagues in here,

00:10:39.672 --> 00:10:40.506
like the speaker of the House,

00:10:40.506 --> 00:10:41.474
Cameron Sexton.

00:10:41.474 --> 00:10:42.875
And so what we need to hold them

00:10:42.875 --> 00:10:43.976
accountable to is to say,

00:10:43.976 --> 00:10:45.711
let's do the will of all the people

00:10:45.711 --> 00:10:47.013
