00:10:49.348 --> 00:10:49.882
My child's

00:10:49.882 --> 00:10:51.751
life is not going to be worth a gun.

00:10:51.751 --> 00:10:53.285
And so that's what we need to say.

00:10:53.285 --> 00:10:53.819
And that's what I hope

00:10:53.819 --> 00:10:54.353
my colleagues

00:10:54.353 --> 00:10:55.788
on its side of the aisle see.

00:10:55.788 --> 00:10:56.889
Thank you for taking the time.

00:10:56.889 --> 00:10:57.690
Thank you for stepping out

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:58.724
and talking to us. I appreciate it.

00:10:58.724 --> 00:10:59.058
Thank you.

